SUMMARY:Mystic Picnic! in-person\, Raleigh area\, last Saturdays
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nRAIN LOCATION: If 
 significant rain we meet a half mile north across highway 40 to the RDU Ga
 lleria on the right. They have a big food court with outdoor covered seati
 ng area. Bring less then\, we' mostly have to buy their food.\n\nDo you en
 joy spiritual growth? Are you having amazing experiences that you can’t 
 talk about with most people? Join the club!\n\nEvery last Saturday at the 
 Mystic Picnic from March to October\, we create a safe fun outdoor space f
 or meeting kindred souls and clarifying the concepts that set us free in t
 hese ascension times when the realities are so clearly diverging. Which pa
 rallel Earth are you from\, and what are you here to do?\n\nWe share stori
 es and support energy healing\, psychic gifts\, angels\, nature spirits\, 
 ET helpers\, reincarnation\, lucid dreams\, and so much more. We keep it r
 eal\, grounded\, positive\, and heart-centered\, so folks can bring their 
 genuine concerns without the big conspiracies. I’ve experienced so many 
 wonders myself\, so I’ll be hosting a main circle for friendly discussio
 ns. There will be potluck food and a nice grassy field for activities.\n\n
 Bring a chair if you have\, plus food or drink you want to share. I’ll s
 upply cups\, plates\, napkins and utensils\, plus extra chairs and snacks.
  We meet at Lake Crabtree park off Route 40 between Durham and Raleigh\, N
 C. Enter park from Aviation Parkway\, proceed to first parking lot on righ
 t. If lot is full\, drive to the next lot and walk back\, or wait as peopl
 e come and go frequently. You’ll see me with some chairs near the lot (I
 ’ll get the best spot available)\n\nRe-member. You matter. Time and spac
 e are rituals. You decide your own future. Your imagination is the doorway
 . Your consciousness creates your own reality.\n\n"I was alive and I waite
 d for this. Right here\, right now\, there is no other place I wanna be. W
 atching the world wake up from history."\n\\-\\- Jesus Jones video: [https
 ://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GN
 JpLU8qcx8)\n\n"There's a starman waiting in the sky. He's told us not to b
 low it 'cause he knows it's all worthwhile."\n\\-\\- astral David Bowie sa
 ves the world in January's stunning 10 year tribute video: [https://www.yo
 utube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ
 )\n\nMy name is Carl and I’m cross-posting this event in several meetups
  for maximum networking fun. To see our spiritual meetup events [www.meetu
 p.com/inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/](http://www.meetup.com/inner-selves-
 for-outer-mastery/) YouTube channel [https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesM
 astery](https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery) and newsletter [www.S
 ignupISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com) Everyone is welcome to also join a
 nd post their own spiritual community events at [https://www.meetup.com/st
 arseedsofraleigh/](https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofraleigh/)\n\nbest wis
 hes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nSpiritual Teaching and Life Coaching\n[www.I
 nnerSelvesMastery.com](http://www.InnerSelvesMastery.com)\nquick links: [w
 ww.SignupISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com)
